WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.789
In tutorial 8.7, you'll follow
your AI visibility over time,

00:00:10.839 --> 00:00:13.250
for each assistant and each competitor.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:19.660
First, open AI visibility. The filter bar
narrows the whole page to one assistant,

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:23.223
topic, buyer role, market, stage or dates.

00:00:24.228 --> 00:00:30.328
Here, Engine is ChatGPT and Market is
the United Arab Emirates, in English.

00:00:30.378 --> 00:00:34.518
The filtered view shows how often
you're named, and who's named instead.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.897
Clear filters puts the whole page back.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:44.370
Next, Over time shows how often you're
named and cited, and your share of voice,

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.124
run after run. Switch the view here.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:51.680
Each engine over time draws
one line per assistant,

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.118
so you see where you're
gaining and where you're not.

00:00:55.551 --> 00:00:59.540
Share of voice over time does the
same for you and each competitor.

00:01:01.476 --> 00:01:07.576
When your question panel changes, a dashed
line marks that run, like 26 August here.

00:01:07.576 --> 00:01:10.451
Alaventra doesn't compare
it with the run before,

00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:13.689
so new questions never
look like a rise or a fall.

00:01:14.729 --> 00:01:19.580
Further down, How AI describes you gives
an early reading of the tone of the answers

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.327
that name you, and the
words AI uses for you.

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:28.491
Sources AI trusts and Your pages AI cites
show the sites, and the pages of yours,

00:01:28.541 --> 00:01:30.231
that the answers rely on.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:35.745
Did it work? shows whether a page you
published moved how often you're named,

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:38.595
against similar questions it didn't touch.

00:01:38.645 --> 00:01:41.485
Shopping in AI answers
shows any product cards.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:47.970
Finally, click Download CSV to take the
answers, your question panel, sources,

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:50.598
competitors over time or your pages.

00:01:51.603 --> 00:01:56.053
So you can see how your AI visibility
moves, for any slice of your market,

00:01:56.103 --> 00:01:59.269
whether your pages helped,
and take the figures with you.

00:02:00.258 --> 00:02:04.958
So, use the filter bar, read the trend
for each assistant and each competitor,

00:02:05.008 --> 00:02:09.183
see when your questions changed,
see sources, tone and what worked,

00:02:09.233 --> 00:02:10.900
and download a CSV.

00:02:11.909 --> 00:02:17.757
Now you can follow every trend. Next,
set your own AI alerts in tutorial 8.8.
